    <system:String x:Key="Help_GuideTab">User Guide</system:String>
    <system:String x:Key="Help_Guide_Ai_Content">Your personal smart assistant is accessible at any time via the sidebar or the unobtrusive floating shortcut. Ask troubleshooting questions, request explanations on Windows settings, or let the AI run diagnostic scans and optimizations for you safely.</system:String>
    <system:String x:Key="Help_Guide_Ai_Title">AI Assistant &amp; PC Copilot</system:String>
    <system:String x:Key="Help_Guide_Cleaning_Content">Scan and eliminate unnecessary clutter accumulated by your system. Choose from 4 cleaning presets (Quick, Recommended, Deep, or Custom). The tool purges Windows temporary files, obsolete error logs, empties the recycle bin, and clears massive caches across all your browsers without deleting your passwords or bookmarks.</system:String>
    <system:String x:Key="Help_Guide_Cleaning_Title">System Cleaning &amp; Browsers</system:String>
    <system:String x:Key="Help_Guide_Dashboard_Content">The dashboard is the central hub of Coclico. It displays live utilization gauges for your processor, RAM, and hard drives. View top memory-consuming processes at a glance and trigger quick maintenance actions to immediately boost system responsiveness without restarting your PC.</system:String>
    <system:String x:Key="Help_Guide_Dashboard_Title">Dashboard &amp; Live Monitoring</system:String>
    <system:String x:Key="Help_Guide_Health_Content">Verify the physical health of your SSDs and hard drives via S.M.A.R.T. diagnostics and component temperatures. If you experience crashes or unexplained slowdowns, run the Windows integrity repair tool: Coclico orchestrates SFC (/scannow) to replace corrupted system files and DISM (RestoreHealth) to restore a healthy Windows image.</system:String>
    <system:String x:Key="Help_Guide_Health_Title">Hardware Health &amp; Windows Repair</system:String>
    <system:String x:Key="Help_Guide_Installer_Content">Install your favorite software in one click categorized by type (Browsers, Development, Utilities, Media, Gaming) through the secure and official Microsoft Winget catalog. Use the search bar to find thousands of packages, and click &apos;Update All&apos; to upgrade all your installed applications at once.</system:String>
    <system:String x:Key="Help_Guide_Installer_Title">Winget Software Installer</system:String>
    <system:String x:Key="Help_Guide_Network_Content">Test the real latency of your Internet connection (Ping) with a single click. Select and apply the world&apos;s fastest and most secure DNS servers (Cloudflare 1.1.1.1, Google 8.8.8.8, Quad9). In case of connection drops or slowdowns, fix your network instantly using the DNS cache flush tool (Flush DNS) and complete TCP/IP &amp; Winsock stack reset.</system:String>
    <system:String x:Key="Help_Guide_Network_Title">Network Optimization &amp; Latency</system:String>
    <system:String x:Key="Help_Guide_Programs_Content">View all installed software on your PC along with their disk space footprint. Identify and disable applications configured to launch on Windows startup to significantly reduce boot time. Access essential Windows administrative shortcuts in one click: Device Manager, Registry Editor, Services, and Event Viewer.</system:String>
    <system:String x:Key="Help_Guide_Programs_Title">Application Manager &amp; Startup</system:String>
    <system:String x:Key="Help_Guide_Ram_Content">Instantly free physical memory cluttered by Windows and background processes (Working Set, Standby List). Enable automatic cleaning so Coclico monitors your memory in the background and purges it automatically based on a schedule or whenever a critical threshold (e.g., 80%) is exceeded. Active foreground app protection ensures your open games or applications experience zero stutter.</system:String>
    <system:String x:Key="Help_Guide_Ram_Title">RAM Cleaner &amp; Auto-Clean</system:String>
    <system:String x:Key="Help_Guide_Settings_Content">Configure Coclico according to your preferences. Select your favorite accent color, adjust acrylic background and card opacity, set font size, toggle compact mode, enable startup with Windows and minimize to the system tray, and switch languages instantly between French and English.</system:String>
    <system:String x:Key="Help_Guide_Settings_Title">Settings &amp; Personalization</system:String>
    <system:String x:Key="Help_Guide_Subtitle">Discover detailed instructions and learn how to use every feature of Coclico</system:String>
    <system:String x:Key="Help_InfoTab">Information</system:String>
    <system:String x:Key="Help_Info_Dev_Name">Coclico</system:String>
    <system:String x:Key="Help_Info_Dev_Role">Creator &amp; Lead Developer of Coclico</system:String>
    <system:String x:Key="Help_Info_Dev_Title">Developer &amp; Creator</system:String>
    <system:String x:Key="Help_Info_Status_Text">The application is currently in an active Beta phase (version {0} Beta). The project benefits from continuous and rigorous development. Regular updates are delivered to polish each module, expand functionality, and maximize overall performance.</system:String>
    <system:String x:Key="Help_Info_Status_Title">Project Status: Beta Release</system:String>
    <system:String x:Key="Help_Info_Subtitle">About the Coclico application and its developer</system:String>
    <system:String x:Key="Help_Info_Title">Project Information</system:String>
    <system:String x:Key="Help_Info_Vision_Text">Coclico was created with uncompromising ethics: zero advertising, absolute privacy (no invasive telemetry or user tracking), minimal resource footprint, and complete code transparency.</system:String>
    <system:String x:Key="Help_Info_Vision_Title">Philosophy &amp; User Privacy</system:String>
